{"bookId":"jonah","version":"kjv-strong","source":"eBible KJV2006 USFM","chapters":{"1":{"verses":[{"number":1,"text":"Now the word of the LORD came unto Jonah the son of Amittai, saying,","tokens":[{"text":"Now the"},{"text":"word","strongs":["H1697"]},{"text":"of the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"came unto"},{"text":"Jonah","strongs":["H3124"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"son","strongs":["H1121"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"Amittai","strongs":["H0573"]},{"text":","},{"text":"saying","strongs":["H0559"]},{"text":","}]},{"number":2,"text":"Arise, go to Nineveh, that great city, and cry against it; for their wickedness is come up before me.","tokens":[{"text":"Arise","strongs":["H6965"]},{"text":","},{"text":"go","strongs":["H3212"]},{"text":"to"},{"text":"Nineveh","strongs":["H5210"]},{"text":", that"},{"text":"great","strongs":["H1419"]},{"text":"city","strongs":["H5892"]},{"text":", and"},{"text":"cry","strongs":["H7121"]},{"text":"against it; for their"},{"text":"wickedness","strongs":["H7451"]},{"text":"is come"},{"text":"up","strongs":["H5927"]},{"text":"before","strongs":["H6440"]},{"text":"me."}]},{"number":3,"text":"But Jonah rose up to flee unto Tarshish from the presence of the LORD, and went down to Joppa; and he found a ship going to Tarshish: so he paid the fare thereof, and went down into it, to go with them unto Tarshish from the presence of the LORD.","tokens":[{"text":"But"},{"text":"Jonah","strongs":["H3124"]},{"text":"rose"},{"text":"up","strongs":["H6965"]},{"text":"to"},{"text":"flee","strongs":["H1272"]},{"text":"unto"},{"text":"Tarshish","strongs":["H8659"]},{"text":"from the"},{"text":"presence","strongs":["H6440"]},{"text":"of the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":", and went"},{"text":"down","strongs":["H3381"]},{"text":"to"},{"text":"Joppa","strongs":["H3305"]},{"text":"; and he"},{"text":"found","strongs":["H4672"]},{"text":"a"},{"text":"ship","strongs":["H0591"]},{"text":"going","strongs":["H0935"]},{"text":"to"},{"text":"Tarshish","strongs":["H8659"]},{"text":": so he"},{"text":"paid","strongs":["H5414"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"fare","strongs":["H7939"]},{"text":"thereof, and went"},{"text":"down","strongs":["H3381"]},{"text":"into it, to"},{"text":"go","strongs":["H0935"]},{"text":"with them unto"},{"text":"Tarshish","strongs":["H8659"]},{"text":"from the"},{"text":"presence","strongs":["H6440"]},{"text":"of the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":4,"text":"But the LORD sent out a great wind into the sea, and there was a mighty tempest in the sea, so that the ship was like to be broken.","tokens":[{"text":"But the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"sent"},{"text":"out","strongs":["H2904"]},{"text":"a"},{"text":"great","strongs":["H1419"]},{"text":"wind","strongs":["H7307"]},{"text":"into the"},{"text":"sea","strongs":["H3220"]},{"text":", and there was a"},{"text":"mighty","strongs":["H1419"]},{"text":"tempest","strongs":["H5591"]},{"text":"in the"},{"text":"sea","strongs":["H3220"]},{"text":", so that the"},{"text":"ship","strongs":["H0591"]},{"text":"was"},{"text":"like","strongs":["H2803"]},{"text":"to be"},{"text":"broken","strongs":["H7665"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":5,"text":"Then the mariners were afraid, and cried every man unto his god, and cast forth the wares that were in the ship into the sea, to lighten it of them. But Jonah was gone down into the sides of the ship; and he lay, and was fast asleep.","tokens":[{"text":"Then the"},{"text":"mariners","strongs":["H4419"]},{"text":"were"},{"text":"afraid","strongs":["H3372"]},{"text":", and"},{"text":"cried","strongs":["H2199"]},{"text":"every"},{"text":"man","strongs":["H0376"]},{"text":"unto his"},{"text":"god","strongs":["H0430"]},{"text":", and cast"},{"text":"forth","strongs":["H2904"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"wares","strongs":["H3627"]},{"text":"that were in the"},{"text":"ship","strongs":["H0591"]},{"text":"into the"},{"text":"sea","strongs":["H3220"]},{"text":", to"},{"text":"lighten","strongs":["H7043"]},{"text":"it of them. But"},{"text":"Jonah","strongs":["H3124"]},{"text":"was gone"},{"text":"down","strongs":["H3381"]},{"text":"into the"},{"text":"sides","strongs":["H3411"]},{"text":"of the"},{"text":"ship","strongs":["H5600"]},{"text":"; and he"},{"text":"lay","strongs":["H7901"]},{"text":", and was fast"},{"text":"asleep","strongs":["H7290"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":6,"text":"So the shipmaster came to him, and said unto him, What meanest thou, O sleeper? arise, call upon thy God, if so be that God will think upon us, that we perish not.","tokens":[{"text":"So the"},{"text":"shipmaster","strongs":["H7227"]},{"text":"came","strongs":["H7126"]},{"text":"to him, and"},{"text":"said","strongs":["H0559"]},{"text":"unto him, What meanest thou, O"},{"text":"sleeper","strongs":["H7290"]},{"text":"?"},{"text":"arise","strongs":["H6965"]},{"text":","},{"text":"call","strongs":["H7121"]},{"text":"upon thy"},{"text":"God","strongs":["H0430"]},{"text":", if so be that"},{"text":"God","strongs":["H0430"]},{"text":"will"},{"text":"think","strongs":["H6245"]},{"text":"upon us, that we"},{"text":"perish","strongs":["H0006"]},{"text":"not."}]},{"number":7,"text":"And they said every one to his fellow, Come, and let us cast lots, that we may know for whose cause this evil is upon us. So they cast lots, and the lot fell upon Jonah.","tokens":[{"text":"And they"},{"text":"said","strongs":["H0559"]},{"text":"every"},{"text":"one","strongs":["H0376"]},{"text":"to his"},{"text":"fellow","strongs":["H7453"]},{"text":","},{"text":"Come","strongs":["H3212"]},{"text":", and let us"},{"text":"cast","strongs":["H5307"]},{"text":"lots","strongs":["H1486"]},{"text":", that we may"},{"text":"know","strongs":["H3045"]},{"text":"for whose"},{"text":"cause","strongs":["H7945"]},{"text":"this"},{"text":"evil","strongs":["H7451"]},{"text":"is upon us. So they"},{"text":"cast","strongs":["H5307"]},{"text":"lots","strongs":["H1486"]},{"text":", and the"},{"text":"lot","strongs":["H1486"]},{"text":"fell","strongs":["H5307"]},{"text":"upon"},{"text":"Jonah","strongs":["H3124"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":8,"text":"Then said they unto him, Tell us, we pray thee, for whose cause this evil is upon us; What is thine occupation? and whence comest thou? what is thy country? and of what people art thou?","tokens":[{"text":"Then"},{"text":"said","strongs":["H0559"]},{"text":"they unto him,"},{"text":"Tell","strongs":["H5046"]},{"text":"us, we pray thee, for whose cause this"},{"text":"evil","strongs":["H7451"]},{"text":"is upon us; What is thine"},{"text":"occupation","strongs":["H4399"]},{"text":"? and"},{"text":"whence","strongs":["H0370"]},{"text":"comest","strongs":["H0935"]},{"text":"thou? what is thy"},{"text":"country","strongs":["H0776"]},{"text":"? and of what"},{"text":"people","strongs":["H5971"]},{"text":"art thou?"}]},{"number":9,"text":"And he said unto them, I am an Hebrew; and I fear the LORD, the God of heaven, which hath made the sea and the dry land.","tokens":[{"text":"And he"},{"text":"said","strongs":["H0559"]},{"text":"unto them, I am an"},{"text":"Hebrew","strongs":["H5680"]},{"text":"; and I"},{"text":"fear","strongs":["H3373"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":", the"},{"text":"God","strongs":["H0430"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"heaven","strongs":["H8064"]},{"text":", which hath"},{"text":"made","strongs":["H6213"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"sea","strongs":["H3220"]},{"text":"and the"},{"text":"dry","strongs":["H3004"]},{"text":"land."}]},{"number":10,"text":"Then were the men exceedingly afraid, and said unto him, Why hast thou done this? For the men knew that he fled from the presence of the LORD, because he had told them.","tokens":[{"text":"Then were the"},{"text":"men","strongs":["H0582"]},{"text":"exceedingly","strongs":["H1419"]},{"text":"afraid","strongs":["H3372"]},{"text":", and"},{"text":"said","strongs":["H0559"]},{"text":"unto him, Why hast thou"},{"text":"done","strongs":["H6213"]},{"text":"this? For the"},{"text":"men","strongs":["H0582"]},{"text":"knew","strongs":["H3045"]},{"text":"that he"},{"text":"fled","strongs":["H1272"]},{"text":"from the"},{"text":"presence","strongs":["H6440"]},{"text":"of the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":", because he had"},{"text":"told","strongs":["H5046"]},{"text":"them."}]},{"number":11,"text":"Then said they unto him, What shall we do unto thee, that the sea may be calm unto us? for the sea wrought, and was tempestuous.","tokens":[{"text":"Then"},{"text":"said","strongs":["H0559"]},{"text":"they unto him, What shall we"},{"text":"do","strongs":["H6213"]},{"text":"unto thee, that the"},{"text":"sea","strongs":["H3220"]},{"text":"may be"},{"text":"calm","strongs":["H8367"]},{"text":"unto us? for the"},{"text":"sea","strongs":["H3220"]},{"text":"wrought","strongs":["H1980"]},{"text":", and was"},{"text":"tempestuous","strongs":["H5590"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":12,"text":"And he said unto them, Take me up, and cast me forth into the sea; so shall the sea be calm unto you: for I know that for my sake this great tempest is upon you.","tokens":[{"text":"And he"},{"text":"said","strongs":["H0559"]},{"text":"unto them, Take me"},{"text":"up","strongs":["H5375"]},{"text":", and cast me"},{"text":"forth","strongs":["H2904"]},{"text":"into the"},{"text":"sea","strongs":["H3220"]},{"text":"; so shall the"},{"text":"sea","strongs":["H3220"]},{"text":"be"},{"text":"calm","strongs":["H8367"]},{"text":"unto you: for I"},{"text":"know","strongs":["H3045"]},{"text":"that for my"},{"text":"sake","strongs":["H7945"]},{"text":"this"},{"text":"great","strongs":["H1419"]},{"text":"tempest","strongs":["H5591"]},{"text":"is upon you."}]},{"number":13,"text":"Nevertheless the men rowed hard to bring it to the land; but they could not: for the sea wrought, and was tempestuous against them.","tokens":[{"text":"Nevertheless the"},{"text":"men","strongs":["H0582"]},{"text":"rowed"},{"text":"hard","strongs":["H2864"]},{"text":"to"},{"text":"bring","strongs":["H7725"]},{"text":"it to the"},{"text":"land","strongs":["H3004"]},{"text":"; but they"},{"text":"could","strongs":["H3201"]},{"text":"not: for the"},{"text":"sea","strongs":["H3220"]},{"text":"wrought","strongs":["H1980"]},{"text":", and was"},{"text":"tempestuous","strongs":["H5590"]},{"text":"against them."}]},{"number":14,"text":"Wherefore they cried unto the LORD, and said, We beseech thee, O LORD, we beseech thee, let us not perish for this man’s life, and lay not upon us innocent blood: for thou, O LORD, hast done as it pleased thee.","tokens":[{"text":"Wherefore they"},{"text":"cried","strongs":["H7121"]},{"text":"unto the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":", and"},{"text":"said","strongs":["H0559"]},{"text":", We beseech"},{"text":"thee","strongs":["H0577"]},{"text":", O"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":", we beseech thee, let us not"},{"text":"perish","strongs":["H0006"]},{"text":"for this"},{"text":"man’s","strongs":["H0376"]},{"text":"life","strongs":["H5315"]},{"text":", and"},{"text":"lay","strongs":["H5414"]},{"text":"not upon us"},{"text":"innocent","strongs":["H5355"]},{"text":"blood","strongs":["H1818"]},{"text":": for thou, O"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":", hast"},{"text":"done","strongs":["H6213"]},{"text":"as it"},{"text":"pleased","strongs":["H2654"]},{"text":"thee."}]},{"number":15,"text":"So they took up Jonah, and cast him forth into the sea: and the sea ceased from her raging.","tokens":[{"text":"So they took"},{"text":"up","strongs":["H5375"]},{"text":"Jonah","strongs":["H3124"]},{"text":", and cast him"},{"text":"forth","strongs":["H2904"]},{"text":"into the"},{"text":"sea","strongs":["H3220"]},{"text":": and the"},{"text":"sea","strongs":["H3220"]},{"text":"ceased","strongs":["H5975"]},{"text":"from her"},{"text":"raging","strongs":["H2197"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":16,"text":"Then the men feared the LORD exceedingly, and offered a sacrifice unto the LORD, and made vows.","tokens":[{"text":"Then the"},{"text":"men","strongs":["H0582"]},{"text":"feared","strongs":["H3372"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"exceedingly","strongs":["H1419"]},{"text":", and"},{"text":"offered","strongs":["H2076"]},{"text":"a"},{"text":"sacrifice","strongs":["H2077"]},{"text":"unto the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":", and"},{"text":"made","strongs":["H5087"]},{"text":"vows","strongs":["H5088"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":17,"text":"Now the LORD had prepared a great fish to swallow up Jonah. And Jonah was in the belly of the fish three days and three nights.","tokens":[{"text":"Now the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"had"},{"text":"prepared","strongs":["H4487"]},{"text":"a"},{"text":"great","strongs":["H1419"]},{"text":"fish","strongs":["H1709"]},{"text":"to swallow"},{"text":"up","strongs":["H1104"]},{"text":"Jonah","strongs":["H3124"]},{"text":". And"},{"text":"Jonah","strongs":["H3124"]},{"text":"was in the"},{"text":"belly","strongs":["H4578"]},{"text":"of the"},{"text":"fish","strongs":["H1709"]},{"text":"three","strongs":["H7969"]},{"text":"days","strongs":["H3117"]},{"text":"and"},{"text":"three","strongs":["H7969"]},{"text":"nights","strongs":["H3915"]},{"text":"."}]}]},"2":{"verses":[{"number":1,"text":"Then Jonah prayed unto the LORD his God out of the fish’s belly,","tokens":[{"text":"Then"},{"text":"Jonah","strongs":["H3124"]},{"text":"prayed","strongs":["H6419"]},{"text":"unto the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"his"},{"text":"God","strongs":["H0430"]},{"text":"out of the"},{"text":"fish’s","strongs":["H1710"]},{"text":"belly","strongs":["H4578"]},{"text":","}]},{"number":2,"text":"And said, I cried by reason of mine affliction unto the LORD, and he heard me; out of the belly of hell cried I, and thou heardest my voice.","tokens":[{"text":"And"},{"text":"said","strongs":["H0559"]},{"text":", I"},{"text":"cried","strongs":["H7121"]},{"text":"by reason of mine"},{"text":"affliction","strongs":["H6869"]},{"text":"unto the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":", and he"},{"text":"heard","strongs":["H6030"]},{"text":"me; out of the"},{"text":"belly","strongs":["H0990"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"hell","strongs":["H7585"]},{"text":"cried","strongs":["H7768"]},{"text":"I, and thou"},{"text":"heardest","strongs":["H8085"]},{"text":"my"},{"text":"voice","strongs":["H6963"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":3,"text":"For thou hadst cast me into the deep, in the midst of the seas; and the floods compassed me about: all thy billows and thy waves passed over me.","tokens":[{"text":"For thou hadst"},{"text":"cast","strongs":["H7993"]},{"text":"me into the"},{"text":"deep","strongs":["H4688"]},{"text":", in the"},{"text":"midst","strongs":["H3824"]},{"text":"of the"},{"text":"seas","strongs":["H3220"]},{"text":"; and the"},{"text":"floods","strongs":["H5104"]},{"text":"compassed","strongs":["H5437"]},{"text":"me about: all thy"},{"text":"billows","strongs":["H4867"]},{"text":"and thy"},{"text":"waves","strongs":["H1530"]},{"text":"passed"},{"text":"over","strongs":["H5674"]},{"text":"me."}]},{"number":4,"text":"Then I said, I am cast out of thy sight; yet I will look again toward thy holy temple.","tokens":[{"text":"Then I"},{"text":"said","strongs":["H0559"]},{"text":", I am cast"},{"text":"out","strongs":["H1644"]},{"text":"of thy"},{"text":"sight","strongs":["H5869"]},{"text":"; yet I will"},{"text":"look","strongs":["H5027"]},{"text":"again","strongs":["H3254"]},{"text":"toward thy"},{"text":"holy","strongs":["H6944"]},{"text":"temple","strongs":["H1964"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":5,"text":"The waters compassed me about, even to the soul: the depth closed me round about, the weeds were wrapped about my head.","tokens":[{"text":"The"},{"text":"waters","strongs":["H4325"]},{"text":"compassed me"},{"text":"about","strongs":["H0661"]},{"text":", even to the"},{"text":"soul","strongs":["H5315"]},{"text":": the"},{"text":"depth","strongs":["H8415"]},{"text":"closed me round"},{"text":"about","strongs":["H5437"]},{"text":", the"},{"text":"weeds","strongs":["H5488"]},{"text":"were wrapped"},{"text":"about","strongs":["H2280"]},{"text":"my"},{"text":"head","strongs":["H7218"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":6,"text":"I went down to the bottoms of the mountains; the earth with her bars was about me for ever: yet hast thou brought up my life from corruption, O LORD my God.","tokens":[{"text":"I went"},{"text":"down","strongs":["H3381"]},{"text":"to the"},{"text":"bottoms","strongs":["H7095"]},{"text":"of the"},{"text":"mountains","strongs":["H2022"]},{"text":"; the"},{"text":"earth","strongs":["H0776"]},{"text":"with her"},{"text":"bars","strongs":["H1280"]},{"text":"was about me for"},{"text":"ever","strongs":["H5769"]},{"text":": yet hast thou brought"},{"text":"up","strongs":["H5927"]},{"text":"my"},{"text":"life","strongs":["H2416"]},{"text":"from"},{"text":"corruption","strongs":["H7845"]},{"text":", O"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"my"},{"text":"God","strongs":["H0430"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":7,"text":"When my soul fainted within me I remembered the LORD: and my prayer came in unto thee, into thine holy temple.","tokens":[{"text":"When my"},{"text":"soul","strongs":["H5315"]},{"text":"fainted","strongs":["H5848"]},{"text":"within me I"},{"text":"remembered","strongs":["H2142"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":": and my"},{"text":"prayer","strongs":["H8605"]},{"text":"came"},{"text":"in","strongs":["H0935"]},{"text":"unto thee, into thine"},{"text":"holy","strongs":["H6944"]},{"text":"temple","strongs":["H1964"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":8,"text":"They that observe lying vanities forsake their own mercy.","tokens":[{"text":"They that"},{"text":"observe","strongs":["H8104"]},{"text":"lying","strongs":["H7723"]},{"text":"vanities","strongs":["H1892"]},{"text":"forsake","strongs":["H5800"]},{"text":"their own"},{"text":"mercy","strongs":["H2617"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":9,"text":"But I will sacrifice unto thee with the voice of thanksgiving; I will pay that that I have vowed. Salvation is of the LORD.","tokens":[{"text":"But I will"},{"text":"sacrifice","strongs":["H2076"]},{"text":"unto thee with the"},{"text":"voice","strongs":["H6963"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"thanksgiving","strongs":["H8426"]},{"text":"; I will"},{"text":"pay","strongs":["H7999"]},{"text":"that that I have"},{"text":"vowed","strongs":["H5087"]},{"text":"."},{"text":"Salvation","strongs":["H3444"]},{"text":"is of the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":10,"text":"And the LORD spake unto the fish, and it vomited out Jonah upon the dry land.","tokens":[{"text":"And the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"spake","strongs":["H0559"]},{"text":"unto the"},{"text":"fish","strongs":["H1709"]},{"text":", and it vomited"},{"text":"out","strongs":["H6958"]},{"text":"Jonah","strongs":["H3124"]},{"text":"upon the"},{"text":"dry","strongs":["H3004"]},{"text":"land."}]}]},"3":{"verses":[{"number":1,"text":"And the word of the LORD came unto Jonah the second time, saying,","tokens":[{"text":"And the"},{"text":"word","strongs":["H1697"]},{"text":"of the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"came unto"},{"text":"Jonah","strongs":["H3124"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"second","strongs":["H8145"]},{"text":"time,"},{"text":"saying","strongs":["H0559"]},{"text":","}]},{"number":2,"text":"Arise, go unto Nineveh, that great city, and preach unto it the preaching that I bid thee.","tokens":[{"text":"Arise","strongs":["H6965"]},{"text":","},{"text":"go","strongs":["H3212"]},{"text":"unto"},{"text":"Nineveh","strongs":["H5210"]},{"text":", that"},{"text":"great","strongs":["H1419"]},{"text":"city","strongs":["H5892"]},{"text":", and"},{"text":"preach","strongs":["H7121"]},{"text":"unto it the"},{"text":"preaching","strongs":["H7150"]},{"text":"that I"},{"text":"bid","strongs":["H1696"]},{"text":"thee."}]},{"number":3,"text":"So Jonah arose, and went unto Nineveh, according to the word of the LORD. Now Nineveh was an exceeding great city of three days’ journey.","tokens":[{"text":"So"},{"text":"Jonah","strongs":["H3124"]},{"text":"arose","strongs":["H6965"]},{"text":", and"},{"text":"went","strongs":["H3212"]},{"text":"unto"},{"text":"Nineveh","strongs":["H5210"]},{"text":", according to the"},{"text":"word","strongs":["H1697"]},{"text":"of the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":". Now"},{"text":"Nineveh","strongs":["H5210"]},{"text":"was an"},{"text":"exceeding","strongs":["H0430"]},{"text":"great","strongs":["H1419"]},{"text":"city","strongs":["H5892"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"three","strongs":["H7969"]},{"text":"days’","strongs":["H3117"]},{"text":"journey","strongs":["H4109"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":4,"text":"And Jonah began to enter into the city a day’s journey, and he cried, and said, Yet forty days, and Nineveh shall be overthrown.","tokens":[{"text":"And"},{"text":"Jonah","strongs":["H3124"]},{"text":"began","strongs":["H2490"]},{"text":"to"},{"text":"enter","strongs":["H0935"]},{"text":"into the"},{"text":"city","strongs":["H5892"]},{"text":"a","strongs":["H0259"]},{"text":"day’s","strongs":["H3117"]},{"text":"journey","strongs":["H4109"]},{"text":", and he"},{"text":"cried","strongs":["H7121"]},{"text":", and"},{"text":"said","strongs":["H0559"]},{"text":", Yet"},{"text":"forty","strongs":["H0705"]},{"text":"days","strongs":["H3117"]},{"text":", and"},{"text":"Nineveh","strongs":["H5210"]},{"text":"shall be"},{"text":"overthrown","strongs":["H2015"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":5,"text":"So the people of Nineveh believed God, and proclaimed a fast, and put on sackcloth, from the greatest of them even to the least of them.","tokens":[{"text":"So the"},{"text":"people","strongs":["H0582"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"Nineveh","strongs":["H5210"]},{"text":"believed","strongs":["H0539"]},{"text":"God","strongs":["H0430"]},{"text":", and"},{"text":"proclaimed","strongs":["H7121"]},{"text":"a"},{"text":"fast","strongs":["H6685"]},{"text":", and"},{"text":"put","strongs":["H3847"]},{"text":"on"},{"text":"sackcloth","strongs":["H8242"]},{"text":", from the"},{"text":"greatest","strongs":["H1419"]},{"text":"of them even to the"},{"text":"least","strongs":["H6996"]},{"text":"of them."}]},{"number":6,"text":"For word came unto the king of Nineveh, and he arose from his throne, and he laid his robe from him, and covered him with sackcloth, and sat in ashes.","tokens":[{"text":"For"},{"text":"word","strongs":["H1697"]},{"text":"came","strongs":["H5060"]},{"text":"unto the"},{"text":"king","strongs":["H4428"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"Nineveh","strongs":["H5210"]},{"text":", and he"},{"text":"arose","strongs":["H6965"]},{"text":"from his"},{"text":"throne","strongs":["H3678"]},{"text":", and he"},{"text":"laid","strongs":["H5674"]},{"text":"his"},{"text":"robe","strongs":["H0155"]},{"text":"from him, and"},{"text":"covered","strongs":["H3680"]},{"text":"him with"},{"text":"sackcloth","strongs":["H8242"]},{"text":", and"},{"text":"sat","strongs":["H3427"]},{"text":"in"},{"text":"ashes","strongs":["H0665"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":7,"text":"And he caused it to be proclaimed and published through Nineveh by the decree of the king and his nobles, saying, Let neither man nor beast, herd nor flock, taste any thing: let them not feed, nor drink water:","tokens":[{"text":"And he caused it to be"},{"text":"proclaimed","strongs":["H2199"]},{"text":"and"},{"text":"published","strongs":["H0559"]},{"text":"through"},{"text":"Nineveh","strongs":["H5210"]},{"text":"by the"},{"text":"decree","strongs":["H2940"]},{"text":"of the"},{"text":"king","strongs":["H4428"]},{"text":"and his"},{"text":"nobles","strongs":["H1419"]},{"text":","},{"text":"saying","strongs":["H0559"]},{"text":", Let neither"},{"text":"man","strongs":["H0120"]},{"text":"nor"},{"text":"beast","strongs":["H0929"]},{"text":","},{"text":"herd","strongs":["H1241"]},{"text":"nor"},{"text":"flock","strongs":["H6629"]},{"text":","},{"text":"taste","strongs":["H2938"]},{"text":"any"},{"text":"thing","strongs":["H3972"]},{"text":": let them not"},{"text":"feed","strongs":["H7462"]},{"text":", nor"},{"text":"drink","strongs":["H8354"]},{"text":"water","strongs":["H4325"]},{"text":":"}]},{"number":8,"text":"But let man and beast be covered with sackcloth, and cry mightily unto God: yea, let them turn every one from his evil way, and from the violence that is in their hands.","tokens":[{"text":"But let"},{"text":"man","strongs":["H0120"]},{"text":"and"},{"text":"beast","strongs":["H0929"]},{"text":"be"},{"text":"covered","strongs":["H3680"]},{"text":"with"},{"text":"sackcloth","strongs":["H8242"]},{"text":", and"},{"text":"cry","strongs":["H7121"]},{"text":"mightily","strongs":["H2394"]},{"text":"unto"},{"text":"God","strongs":["H0430"]},{"text":": yea, let them"},{"text":"turn","strongs":["H7725"]},{"text":"every"},{"text":"one","strongs":["H0376"]},{"text":"from his"},{"text":"evil","strongs":["H7451"]},{"text":"way","strongs":["H1870"]},{"text":", and from the"},{"text":"violence","strongs":["H2555"]},{"text":"that is in their"},{"text":"hands","strongs":["H3709"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":9,"text":"Who can tell if God will turn and repent, and turn away from his fierce anger, that we perish not?","tokens":[{"text":"Who can"},{"text":"tell","strongs":["H3045"]},{"text":"if"},{"text":"God","strongs":["H0430"]},{"text":"will"},{"text":"turn","strongs":["H7725"]},{"text":"and"},{"text":"repent","strongs":["H5162"]},{"text":", and turn"},{"text":"away","strongs":["H7725"]},{"text":"from his"},{"text":"fierce","strongs":["H2740"]},{"text":"anger","strongs":["H0639"]},{"text":", that we"},{"text":"perish","strongs":["H0006"]},{"text":"not?"}]},{"number":10,"text":"And God saw their works, that they turned from their evil way; and God repented of the evil, that he had said that he would do unto them; and he did it not.","tokens":[{"text":"And"},{"text":"God","strongs":["H0430"]},{"text":"saw","strongs":["H7200"]},{"text":"their"},{"text":"works","strongs":["H4639"]},{"text":", that they"},{"text":"turned","strongs":["H7725"]},{"text":"from their"},{"text":"evil","strongs":["H7451"]},{"text":"way","strongs":["H1870"]},{"text":"; and"},{"text":"God","strongs":["H0430"]},{"text":"repented","strongs":["H5162"]},{"text":"of the"},{"text":"evil","strongs":["H7451"]},{"text":", that he had"},{"text":"said","strongs":["H1696"]},{"text":"that he would"},{"text":"do","strongs":["H6213"]},{"text":"unto them; and he"},{"text":"did","strongs":["H6213"]},{"text":"it not."}]}]},"4":{"verses":[{"number":1,"text":"But it displeased Jonah exceedingly, and he was very angry.","tokens":[{"text":"But it"},{"text":"displeased","strongs":["H3415"]},{"text":"Jonah","strongs":["H3124"]},{"text":"exceedingly","strongs":["H1419"]},{"text":", and he was very"},{"text":"angry","strongs":["H2734"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":2,"text":"And he prayed unto the LORD, and said, I pray thee, O LORD, was not this my saying, when I was yet in my country? Therefore I fled before unto Tarshish: for I knew that thou art a gracious God, and merciful, slow to anger, and of great kindness, and repentest thee of the evil.","tokens":[{"text":"And he"},{"text":"prayed","strongs":["H6419"]},{"text":"unto the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":", and"},{"text":"said","strongs":["H0559"]},{"text":", I"},{"text":"pray","strongs":["H0577"]},{"text":"thee, O"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":", was not this my"},{"text":"saying","strongs":["H1697"]},{"text":", when I was yet in my"},{"text":"country","strongs":["H0127"]},{"text":"? Therefore I"},{"text":"fled","strongs":["H1272"]},{"text":"before","strongs":["H6923"]},{"text":"unto"},{"text":"Tarshish","strongs":["H8659"]},{"text":": for I"},{"text":"knew","strongs":["H3045"]},{"text":"that thou art a"},{"text":"gracious","strongs":["H2587"]},{"text":"God","strongs":["H0410"]},{"text":", and"},{"text":"merciful","strongs":["H7349"]},{"text":","},{"text":"slow","strongs":["H0750"]},{"text":"to"},{"text":"anger","strongs":["H0639"]},{"text":", and of"},{"text":"great","strongs":["H7227"]},{"text":"kindness","strongs":["H2617"]},{"text":", and"},{"text":"repentest","strongs":["H5162"]},{"text":"thee of the"},{"text":"evil","strongs":["H7451"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":3,"text":"Therefore now, O LORD, take, I beseech thee, my life from me; for it is better for me to die than to live.","tokens":[{"text":"Therefore now, O"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":","},{"text":"take","strongs":["H3947"]},{"text":", I beseech thee, my"},{"text":"life","strongs":["H5315"]},{"text":"from me; for it is"},{"text":"better","strongs":["H2896"]},{"text":"for me to"},{"text":"die","strongs":["H4194"]},{"text":"than to"},{"text":"live","strongs":["H2416"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":4,"text":"Then said the LORD, Doest thou well to be angry?","tokens":[{"text":"Then"},{"text":"said","strongs":["H0559"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":", Doest thou"},{"text":"well","strongs":["H3190"]},{"text":"to be"},{"text":"angry","strongs":["H2734"]},{"text":"?"}]},{"number":5,"text":"So Jonah went out of the city, and sat on the east side of the city, and there made him a booth, and sat under it in the shadow, till he might see what would become of the city.","tokens":[{"text":"So"},{"text":"Jonah","strongs":["H3124"]},{"text":"went"},{"text":"out","strongs":["H3318"]},{"text":"of the"},{"text":"city","strongs":["H5892"]},{"text":", and"},{"text":"sat","strongs":["H3427"]},{"text":"on the east"},{"text":"side","strongs":["H6924"]},{"text":"of the"},{"text":"city","strongs":["H5892"]},{"text":", and there"},{"text":"made","strongs":["H6213"]},{"text":"him a"},{"text":"booth","strongs":["H5521"]},{"text":", and"},{"text":"sat","strongs":["H3427"]},{"text":"under it in the"},{"text":"shadow","strongs":["H6738"]},{"text":", till he might"},{"text":"see","strongs":["H7200"]},{"text":"what would become of the"},{"text":"city","strongs":["H5892"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":6,"text":"And the LORD God prepared a gourd, and made it to come up over Jonah, that it might be a shadow over his head, to deliver him from his grief. So Jonah was exceeding glad of the gourd.","tokens":[{"text":"And the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"God","strongs":["H0430"]},{"text":"prepared","strongs":["H4487"]},{"text":"a"},{"text":"gourd","strongs":["H7021"]},{"text":", and made it to come"},{"text":"up","strongs":["H5927"]},{"text":"over"},{"text":"Jonah","strongs":["H3124"]},{"text":", that it might be a"},{"text":"shadow","strongs":["H6738"]},{"text":"over his"},{"text":"head","strongs":["H7218"]},{"text":", to"},{"text":"deliver","strongs":["H5337"]},{"text":"him from his"},{"text":"grief","strongs":["H7451"]},{"text":". So"},{"text":"Jonah","strongs":["H3124"]},{"text":"was"},{"text":"exceeding","strongs":["H1419"]},{"text":"glad","strongs":["H8055"]},{"text":"of the"},{"text":"gourd","strongs":["H7021"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":7,"text":"But God prepared a worm when the morning rose the next day, and it smote the gourd that it withered.","tokens":[{"text":"But"},{"text":"God","strongs":["H0430"]},{"text":"prepared","strongs":["H4487"]},{"text":"a"},{"text":"worm","strongs":["H8438"]},{"text":"when the"},{"text":"morning","strongs":["H7837"]},{"text":"rose","strongs":["H5927"]},{"text":"the next"},{"text":"day","strongs":["H4283"]},{"text":", and it"},{"text":"smote","strongs":["H5221"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"gourd","strongs":["H7021"]},{"text":"that it"},{"text":"withered","strongs":["H3001"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":8,"text":"And it came to pass, when the sun did arise, that God prepared a vehement east wind; and the sun beat upon the head of Jonah, that he fainted, and wished in himself to die, and said, It is better for me to die than to live.","tokens":[{"text":"And it came to pass, when the"},{"text":"sun","strongs":["H8121"]},{"text":"did"},{"text":"arise","strongs":["H2224"]},{"text":", that"},{"text":"God","strongs":["H0430"]},{"text":"prepared","strongs":["H4487"]},{"text":"a"},{"text":"vehement","strongs":["H2759"]},{"text":"east","strongs":["H6921"]},{"text":"wind","strongs":["H7307"]},{"text":"; and the"},{"text":"sun","strongs":["H8121"]},{"text":"beat","strongs":["H5221"]},{"text":"upon the"},{"text":"head","strongs":["H7218"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"Jonah","strongs":["H3124"]},{"text":", that he"},{"text":"fainted","strongs":["H5968"]},{"text":", and"},{"text":"wished","strongs":["H7592"]},{"text":"in"},{"text":"himself","strongs":["H5315"]},{"text":"to"},{"text":"die","strongs":["H4191"]},{"text":", and"},{"text":"said","strongs":["H0559"]},{"text":", It is"},{"text":"better","strongs":["H2896"]},{"text":"for me to"},{"text":"die","strongs":["H4194"]},{"text":"than to"},{"text":"live","strongs":["H2416"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":9,"text":"And God said to Jonah, Doest thou well to be angry for the gourd? And he said, I do well to be angry, even unto death.","tokens":[{"text":"And"},{"text":"God","strongs":["H0430"]},{"text":"said","strongs":["H0559"]},{"text":"to"},{"text":"Jonah","strongs":["H3124"]},{"text":", Doest thou"},{"text":"well","strongs":["H3190"]},{"text":"to be"},{"text":"angry","strongs":["H2734"]},{"text":"for the"},{"text":"gourd","strongs":["H7021"]},{"text":"? And he"},{"text":"said","strongs":["H0559"]},{"text":", I do"},{"text":"well","strongs":["H3190"]},{"text":"to be"},{"text":"angry","strongs":["H2734"]},{"text":", even unto"},{"text":"death","strongs":["H4194"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":10,"text":"Then said the LORD, Thou hast had pity on the gourd, for the which thou hast not laboured, neither madest it grow; which came up in a night, and perished in a night:","tokens":[{"text":"Then"},{"text":"said","strongs":["H0559"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":", Thou hast had"},{"text":"pity","strongs":["H2347"]},{"text":"on the"},{"text":"gourd","strongs":["H7021"]},{"text":", for the which thou hast not"},{"text":"laboured","strongs":["H5998"]},{"text":", neither madest it"},{"text":"grow","strongs":["H1431"]},{"text":"; which came up in a"},{"text":"night","strongs":["H1121"]},{"text":", and"},{"text":"perished","strongs":["H0006"]},{"text":"in a"},{"text":"night","strongs":["H1121"]},{"text":":"}]},{"number":11,"text":"And should not I spare Nineveh, that great city, wherein are more than sixscore thousand persons that cannot discern between their right hand and their left hand; and also much cattle?","tokens":[{"text":"And should not I"},{"text":"spare","strongs":["H2347"]},{"text":"Nineveh","strongs":["H5210"]},{"text":", that"},{"text":"great","strongs":["H1419"]},{"text":"city","strongs":["H5892"]},{"text":", wherein"},{"text":"are","strongs":["H3426"]},{"text":"more","strongs":["H7235"]},{"text":"than"},{"text":"sixscore","strongs":["H8147"]},{"text":"thousand","strongs":["H7239"]},{"text":"persons","strongs":["H0120"]},{"text":"that cannot"},{"text":"discern","strongs":["H3045"]},{"text":"between their right"},{"text":"hand","strongs":["H3225"]},{"text":"and their left"},{"text":"hand","strongs":["H8040"]},{"text":"; and also"},{"text":"much","strongs":["H7227"]},{"text":"cattle","strongs":["H0929"]},{"text":"?"}]}]}}}